\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Round the Lord in glory seated,
\par Cherubim and seraphim
\par Filled His temple and repeated
\par Each to each the alternate hymn;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lord, Thy glory fills the heaven,
\par Earth is with its fullness stored;
\par Unto Thee be glory given,
\par Holy, holy, holy, Lord!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Heaven is still with glory ringing,
\par Earth takes up the angel's cry,
\par Holy, holy, holy, singing,
\par Lord Of Hosts, the Lord most high;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lord, Thy glory fills the heaven,
\par Earth is with its fullness stored;
\par Unto Thee be glory given,
\par Holy, holy, holy, Lord!
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. With His seraph-train before Him,
\par With His holy church below,
\par Thus unite we to adore Him,
\par Bid we thus our anthem flow;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Lord, Thy glory fills the heaven,
\par Earth is with its fullness stored;
\par Unto Thee be glory given,
\par Holy, holy, holy, Lord!
\par \i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

